        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S811, Modern Stainless Steel Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 9 Inch Stainless Steel Lockset is available in single cylinder, interconnected single cylinder, or dummy functions. An interconnected single cylinder is great for homes because it provides security not only through the trusted the Schlage cylinder but also because it allows for immediate egress in case of an emergency. The interior trim opens the door without worrying about unlocking the deadbolt first. This Stainless Steel Sideplate Lockset has a brushed stainless steel finish that looks amazing and contemporary. Choose from a wide array of modern knobs and levers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern 9 Inch Stainless Steel Entry Door Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Stainless Steel Sideplate Locksets:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/2\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-S811-specifications.pdf?v=1704262348\"><b>Emtek S811 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Interconnected Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. The interior knob/lever opens the door without having to unlock the deadbolt for immediate egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "9 Inch Stainless Steel Lockset",
                "description": "The 9 Inch Stainless Steel Lockset is available in single cylinder, interconnected single cylinder, or dummy functions. An interconnected single cylinder is great for homes because it provides security not only through the trusted the Schlage cylinder but also because it allows for immediate egress in case of an emergency. The interior trim opens the door without worrying about unlocking the deadbolt first. This Stainless Steel Sideplate Lockset has a brushed stainless steel finish that looks amazing and contemporary. Choose from a wide array of modern knobs and levers. \r\n",
